# Strategy Translate Invariants (Anti-屎上雕花)

## Quality verdict
If a pack fails contract / sanity asserts, it is garbage. Do not optimize it. Reset.

## Cursor role = 精密打字员
- Translate the contract + pseudocode into DSL only.
- Forbidden: invent filters, raise vol thresholds, swap asia/macro boxes, add EMA/CCI/RSI core, "helpful" branches, unexplained hardcodes.
- If a required primitive is missing from the DSL, stop and declare gap — do not fake it with a lookalike (e.g. swing_extreme(5) ≠ entry wick + 0.08%).

## GLM role = 逻辑翻译官 / 剪枝审判
- Build invariants + minimal assertions first.
- Audit = list deviations; prune = delete only.
- If fix needs new logic not in the contract → decision RESET (rewrite from contract), never additive PATCH.

## Pipeline order (mandatory)
1. Invariants contract
2. Minimal sanity asserts (must pass)
3. Minimal skeleton DSL
4. Re-run asserts
5. Only then L0 / L1 / Gate2

## Hard bans
- No additive "optimization" before pretest_quality pass
- No Gate2 floor lowering
- No live mount / human confirm bypass
